{"name":"A Brand New Day","hex":"#ffaabb","fetched":"2026-10-16","looked":{"definitions":[{"term":"brand","whole":false,"parts":[{"part":"Noun","definitions":["A mark or scar made by burning with a hot iron, especially to mark cattle or to classify the contents of a cask.","A branding iron."]},{"part":"Verb","definitions":["To burn the flesh with a hot iron, either as a marker (for criminals, slaves etc.) or to cauterise a wound.","To mark (especially cattle) with a brand as proof of ownership."]}],"link":"https://en.wiktionary.org/wiki/brand"},{"term":"new","whole":false,"parts":[{"part":"Symbol","definitions":["ISO 639-2 & ISO 639-3 language code for Newar."]},{"part":"Adjective","definitions":["Recently made, or created.","Of recent origin; having taken place recently."]}],"link":"https://en.wiktionary.org/wiki/new"},{"term":"day","whole":false,"parts":[{"part":"Symbol","definitions":["ISO 639-2 & ISO 639-5 language code for Land Dayak languages."]},{"part":"Noun","definitions":["The time when the Sun is above the horizon and it lights the sky.","A period of time equal or almost equal to a full day-night cycle, being 24 hours long."]}],"link":"https://en.wiktionary.org/wiki/day"}],"entries":[{"title":"Brand New Day (Swollen Members album)","blocks":[{"text":"Brand New Day is the eighth studio album by Canadian hip-hop group Swollen Members. It was released on June 17, 2014 via Battle Axe Records. Recording sessions took place at the Chambers Studio in Vancouver and at Blue Light Studios. Production was ahndled by Rob The Viking and C-Lance. It features guest appearances from DJ Makeway and DJ Revolution, and contributions from Dalla Hooper and drummer Tim Proznick. The album peaked at number 8 on the Billboard Canadian Albums, as well as number 146 on the Top Current Albums, number 13 on the Top Rap Albums and number 7 on the Heatseekers Albums charts in the United States."}],"image":"https://upload.wikimedia.org/wikipedia/en/c/c8/Swollen_Members_Brand_New_Day.jp